<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Shell Refining profit up.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Shell Refining profit up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Oper profit		   55.73	 vs	 20.22</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	   18.6	  vs	  6.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		   1,172.0	 vs	1,076.84</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		66.34	vs	   21.26</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	    10.0	 vs	   10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Shell Refining Co (FOM) Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
